      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Crystal Beach</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Ozona</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Curlew</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Dunedin</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Tarpon Springs</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Oldsmar</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Safety Harbor</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Clearwater</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-20" style="background:#FFFFFF">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-12"><p class="sl gt mb-3">Common Questions</p><h2 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:.95;color:#1A1A1A;letter-spacing:-.01em">PALM HARBOR ROOFING FAQ</h2></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false" onclick="this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',this.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true'?'false':'true');this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('open')">How much does a roof replacement cost in Palm Harbor?<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A1A1A" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">In general, most Palm Harbor residential replacements run between $8,500 and $25,000 for an average-sized home. That said, this number really depends on the size of your roof, the angle it's positioned at, and what material it's made of. It's important to note that homes in communities like Innisbrook and East Lake tend to have larger footprints, which will also affect the total. Call <a href="tel:8135957663" class="call-tracking-number" style="color:#3B9FD9;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600">(813) 595-7663</a> for a free estimate.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false" onclick="this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',this.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true'?'false':'true');this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('open')">How long do roof replacements take?<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A1A1A" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">It depends on the material. Shingle replacements will typically take one to three days, while metal usually runs about three to five. Tile will likely take between five to seven days, though it'll depend on how complex the job is.</div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-grad relative overflow-hidden py-20"><div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 text-center"><h2 class="font-display font-black tracking-tightest mb-4" style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.01em">READY TO GET STARTED<span style="color:#F0C040">?</span></h2><p style="color:rgba(255,248,240,.85);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:2rem">Call us or request a free estimate online. We respond within 24 hours.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center"><a href="/contact" class="btn-t" style="font-size:1.15rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem">Get My Free Estimate <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a><a href="tel:8135957663" class="btn-o call-tracking-number" style="font-size:1.05rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem">Call Now, No Obligation</a></div></div></section>

